    "sections": {
        "description": "The Wedding Managerial Service theme is designed for presenting event planning and wedding-related content through a structured and organized layout. It includes sections for service details, event schedules, galleries, testimonials, pricing information, and contact forms. The homepage supports banner images, featured content blocks, and customizable sections that help organize information clearly across devices. The theme includes responsive layouts, typography controls, color customization options, and navigation settings for flexible presentation. It also supports social media integration, blog sections, image sliders, and footer widget areas for additional content placement. Built with clean code and standard customization options, the theme is compatible with common plugins used for forms, galleries, and SEO management. The layout is optimized for readability and image presentation, making it suitable for displaying event portfolios, service packages, announcements, and booking-related information in a consistent format across desktop and mobile devices."
    },
